0..71 Comment "//! `natural` compares a region-polymorphic function across a widening."
72..75 Comment "//!"
76..154 Comment "//! A view at an outer region stands at an inner region. The pathological twin"
155..237 Comment "//! refuses a reversed widening as `TypeMismatch`. It refuses unequal functions as"
238..261 Comment "//! `EndpointMismatch`."
262..265 Comment "//!"
266..343 Comment "//! The checker verifies each square by conversion. Both examples run to `5`."
344..347 Comment "//!"
348..407 Comment "//! - owes: #2139 — a value type that quantifies a region"
408..480 Comment "//! - see: corpus/pathological/regions/natural.gandr — invalid squares"
482..528 Comment "// `pass` returns a thunk in its input region."
